<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>노르딕 홈 — 민주적 디자인의 가구</title>
<meta name="description" content="노르딕 홈 — 모두를 위한 좋은 디자인. 합리적인 가격의 북유럽 가구와 인테리어. 경기 고양." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Hanken+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  :root {
    --blue: #0051ba;
    --blue-dark: #003580;
    --yellow: #ffda1a;
    --ink: #1a1a1a;
    --gray-900: #2b2b2b;
    --gray-600: #6b6b6b;
    --gray-400: #9a9a9a;
    --gray-200: #e6e6e6;
    --gray-100: #f3f3f3;
    --gray-50: #f8f8f6;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --radius: 6px;
    --maxw: 1180px;
    --ease: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--white);
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .wrap { max-width: var(--maxw); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

  h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }

  a { color: inherit; }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  .nav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 40px;
    z-index: 500;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: var(--white);
  }
  .nav-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    height: 64px;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 19px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--white);
  }
  .logo-mark {
    width: 38px; height: 28px;
    background: var(--yellow);
    border-radius: 3px;
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    color: var(--blue);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 28px; list-style: none; }
  .nav-links a {
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
    transition: color 0.2s var(--ease);
  }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--yellow); }
  .nav-cta {
    background: var(--yellow);
    color: var(--blue) !important;
    padding: 9px 18px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s var(--ease), background 0.2s;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover { background: #ffe34d; transform: translateY(-1px); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .nav-links { display: none; } }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero {
    background: var(--gray-50);
    padding: 72px 0 80px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 1.2rem + 5vw, 4.4rem);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .hero h1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--blue); }
  .hero p {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--gray-600);
    max-width: 460px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 14px 26px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.2s var(--ease), background 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--blue); color: var(--white); }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--blue-dark); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(0,81,186,0.25); }
  .btn-ghost { background: var(--white); color: var(--ink); border: 1.5px solid var(--gray-200); }
  .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--blue); color: var(--blue); }

  .hero-badges { display: flex; gap: 22px; margin-top: 34px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .badge { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--gray-900); }
  .badge .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--blue); }

  /* hero illustration (SVG room) */
  .hero-visual {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin-left: auto;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .hero-visual svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
  .price-tag {
    position: absolute;
    background: var(--yellow);
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 15px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    transform: rotate(-3deg);
  }
  .price-tag small { display: block; font-weight: 600; font-size: 11px; color: var(--gray-600); letter-spacing: 0.03em; }
  .price-tag.t1 { top: 8%; right: 2%; }
  .price-tag.t2 { bottom: 14%; left: -4%; transform: rotate(2deg); }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }
    .hero-visual { margin: 0 auto; }
  }

  /* ---------- VALUES STRIP ---------- */
  .values {
    background: var(--blue);
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 28px 0;
  }
  .values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .value h3 { font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .value h3 span { color: var(--yellow); }
  .value p { font-size: 13.5px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82); line-height: 1.5; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .values-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }

  /* ---------- SECTION HEADERS ---------- */
  .section { padding: 80px 0; }
  .section-head { margin-bottom: 40px; max-width: 640px; }
  .section-head h2 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 1.2rem + 2.4vw, 2.8rem); margin: 12px 0 14px; }
  .section-head p { color: var(--gray-600); font-size: 16.5px; }

  /* ---------- CATALOG GRID ---------- */
  .filters {
    display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .chip {
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 40px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--gray-200);
    background: var(--white);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--gray-600);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.18s var(--ease);
  }
  .chip:hover { border-color: var(--blue); color: var(--blue); }
  .chip.active { background: var(--blue); border-color: var(--blue); color: var(--white); }

  .catalog {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 980px) { .catalog { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .catalog { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .card {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: box-shadow 0.25s var(--ease), transform 0.25s var(--ease);
  }
  .card:hover { box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(0,0,0,0.10); transform: translateY(-4px); }
  .card-media {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    background: var(--gray-100);
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    padding: 18px;
  }
  .card-media svg { width: 78%; height: 78%; }
  .card-fav {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px; right: 10px;
    width: 32px; height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--gray-400);
    transition: color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }
  .card-fav:hover { color: var(--blue); transform: scale(1.1); }
  .card-new {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px; left: 10px;
    background: var(--yellow);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 4px 9px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .card-body { padding: 16px 16px 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; }
  .card-name { font-weight: 800; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .card-desc { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--gray-600); margin: 3px 0 12px; flex: 1; }
  .card-foot { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; }
  .card-price { font-weight: 800; font-size: 20px; }
  .card-price small { display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--gray-400); letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
  .card-item { font-size: 11px; color: var(--gray-400); font-family: 'Inter', monospace; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }

  /* ---------- ROOM SETS ---------- */
  .rooms { background: var(--gray-50); }
  .room-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .room-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .room {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    color: var(--white);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding: 24px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease);
  }
  .room::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0) 35%, rgba(0,40,90,0.78) 100%);
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .room svg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; z-index: 0; }
  .room-text { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .room:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
  .room-tag { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--yellow); }
  .room h3 { font-size: 22px; margin: 6px 0 4px; }
  .room p { font-size: 13.5px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }
  .room-price { margin-top: 12px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
  .room-price b { background: var(--yellow); color: var(--ink); padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 14px; }

  /* ---------- SERVICE / DELIVERY ---------- */
  .service-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .service {
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 28px 24px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  .service:hover { border-color: var(--blue); box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
  .service-ico {
    width: 52px; height: 52px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--gray-100);
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .service h3 { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .service p { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--gray-600); }
  .service ul { list-style: none; margin-top: 12px; }
  .service li { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--gray-900); padding: 5px 0 5px 22px; position: relative; }
  .service li::before {
    content: "✓"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--blue); font-weight: 800;
  }

  .delivery-note {
    margin-top: 32px;
    background: var(--yellow);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 26px 30px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .delivery-note h3 { font-size: 21px; }
  .delivery-note p { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--gray-900); margin-top: 4px; }

  /* ---------- CONTACT ---------- */
  .contact { background: var(--blue); color: var(--white); }
  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; } }
  .contact h2 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 1.2rem + 2.4vw, 2.8rem); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .contact-lead { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.86); font-size: 16.5px; margin-bottom: 28px; max-width: 420px; }
  .contact-list { list-style: none; }
  .contact-list li { display: flex; gap: 14px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18); align-items: flex-start; }
  .contact-list li:first-child { border-top: none; }
  .contact-list .ci-ico { color: var(--yellow); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
  .contact-list .ci-label { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); font-weight: 700; }
  .contact-list .ci-val { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }

  .form {
    background: var(--white);
    color: var(--ink);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 30px;
  }
  .form h3 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .field { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .field label { display: block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; color: var(--gray-900); }
  .field input, .field select, .field textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--gray-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--gray-50);
    transition: border-color 0.18s, background 0.18s;
  }
  .field input:focus, .field select:focus, .field textarea:focus {
    outline: none; border-color: var(--blue); background: var(--white);
  }
  .field textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 92px; }
  .form .btn-primary { width: 100%; justify-content: center; margin-top: 4px; }

  /* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
  .footer {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    padding: 50px 0 30px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .footer-top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    padding-bottom: 36px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .footer-top { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 28px; } }
  .footer h4 { color: var(--white); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
  .footer ul { list-style: none; }
  .footer li { padding: 5px 0; }
  .footer li a { text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s; }
  .footer li a:hover { color: var(--yellow); }
  .footer-brand p { margin-top: 12px; max-width: 280px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .footer-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 18px; color: var(--white); }
  .footer-bot { padding-top: 22px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div style="position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9999;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 16px;background:rgba(7,11,20,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:2px solid #ffb000;font-family:ui-monospace,'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;">
  <a href="/portfolio" style="color:#ffb000;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">← PORTFOLIO</a>
  <span style="color:#8ea0b8;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;">SAMPLE 33 · 노르딕 홈 — 북유럽 가구 카탈로그(IKEA풍) 스타일</span>
  <a href="/contact" style="color:#070b14;background:#ffb000;padding:6px 12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:2px;">제작 문의 →</a>
</div>
<div style="height:40px;"></div>

<!-- ===== NAV ===== -->
<header class="nav">
  <div class="wrap nav-inner">
    <a href="#" class="logo">
      <span class="logo-mark">NH</span>
      노르딕 홈
    </a>
    <nav>
      <ul class="nav-links">
        <li><a href="#catalog">카탈로그</a></li>
        <li><a href="#rooms">룸 세트</a></li>
        <li><a href="#service">배송·조립</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">매장 안내</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">방문 예약</a>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <span class="eyebrow">민주적 디자인 · Democratic Design</span>
      <h1>좋은 디자인은<br /><em>모두의 것</em>이어야 합니다.</h1>
      <p>형태, 기능, 품질, 지속가능성, 그리고 합리적인 가격. 다섯 가지 약속으로 만든 북유럽 가구를 경기 고양 쇼룸에서 만나보세요.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#catalog" class="btn btn-primary">카탈로그 보기 →</a>
        <a href="#rooms" class="btn btn-ghost">룸 세트 둘러보기</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-badges">
        <span class="badge"><span class="dot"></span>10년 품질 보증</span>
        <span class="badge"><span class="dot"></span>무료 디자인 상담</span>
        <span class="badge"><span class="dot"></span>당일 픽업 가능</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual">
      <span class="price-tag t1">₩89,000<small>BJÖRKA 의자</small></span>
      <span class="price-tag t2">₩249,000<small>LAGOM 소파</small></span>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 400 400" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-label="거실 일러스트">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="400" height="400" rx="10" fill="#eef1f4"/>
        <!-- floor -->
        <rect x="0" y="300" width="400" height="100" fill="#e2d5c2"/>
        <!-- rug -->
        <ellipse cx="200" cy="345" rx="150" ry="34" fill="#ffda1a" opacity="0.5"/>
        <!-- wall art -->
        <rect x="58" y="70" width="70" height="90" rx="4" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#0051ba" stroke-width="3"/>
        <circle cx="93" cy="105" r="16" fill="#ffda1a"/>
        <rect x="70" y="130" width="46" height="6" rx="3" fill="#0051ba"/>
        <!-- plant -->
        <rect x="300" y="240" width="40" height="62" rx="4" fill="#c9744a"/>
        <path d="M320 240 C300 200 300 180 312 160" stroke="#2e7d4f" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <path d="M320 240 C340 205 344 184 330 162" stroke="#3a9b63" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <path d="M320 245 C320 215 322 196 320 172" stroke="#2e7d4f" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <!-- sofa -->
        <rect x="70" y="220" width="180" height="60" rx="12" fill="#0051ba"/>
        <rect x="78" y="200" width="60" height="50" rx="10" fill="#1a66c9"/>
        <rect x="138" y="200" width="60" height="50" rx="10" fill="#1a66c9"/>
        <rect x="62" y="232" width="22" height="58" rx="8" fill="#003580"/>
        <rect x="236" y="232" width="22" height="58" rx="8" fill="#003580"/>
        <!-- cushion -->
        <rect x="92" y="206" width="34" height="34" rx="7" fill="#ffda1a"/>
        <!-- side table + lamp -->
        <rect x="278" y="258" width="44" height="44" rx="5" fill="#d8b894"/>
        <rect x="294" y="210" width="12" height="50" rx="4" fill="#9a9a9a"/>
        <path d="M282 210 h36 l-9 -22 h-18 z" fill="#ffda1a"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== VALUES ===== -->
<section class="values">
  <div class="wrap values-grid">
    <div class="value">
      <h3><span>01</span> 형태</h3>
      <p>오래 봐도 질리지 않는 단정한 북유럽 라인.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value">
      <h3><span>02</span> 기능</h3>
      <p>작은 집에서도 똑똑하게 쓰는 수납과 구조.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value">
